    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Instruments that measure and indicate the passage of time, especially by mechanical means producing a regularly recurring action and indicating, usually by hands or changing numbers, the hours and minutes; not designed to be worn or otherwise carried about on a person. For wearable timepieces, see "watches." [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
